  "query_preview": "..\nAll tropical cyclone-related watches and warnings were cancelled \ntoday for the Marianas as Super Typhoon Champi (29W) continues to \nmove away from the region. However, winds will remain moderate to \nstrong over Saipan and Tinian, increasing to near-gale over Rota and \nGuam. A ridge will build in following Champi's exit beginning Monday\nnight, lasting through at least Tuesday, allowing a drier regime to\ndevelop. In the late week, scattered showers may return ahead of \nbroad troughs entering the region from the east.",
